  "details": "In almost every node editor, pasted nodes will appear under the cursor location or in the center of the screen. \n\nCurrently, pasted nodes just get dropped on top of wherever they were copied from, which can be slightly frustrating due to the lack of zoom support. \n\n> Copy node\n> Pan to new part in large graph\n> Paste node\n> Realize you have to pan all the way back",
